usage: neural_preflight.py [-h] --data-dir DATA_DIR --tokenizer TOKENIZER
                           --output OUTPUT [--mapping MAPPING]
                           [--input-max-length INPUT_MAX_LENGTH]
                           [--example-limit EXAMPLE_LIMIT]

Inspect neural data/tokenizer limits without loading a model or scoring it.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --data-dir DATA_DIR   Processed directory with entities.json, qa.jsonl,
                        splits.json.
  --tokenizer TOKENIZER
                        Local tokenizer directory or cached model ID. Never
                        downloaded.
  --output OUTPUT
  --mapping MAPPING     Optional TransE mapping.json to reproduce B0 fact
                        filtering.
  --input-max-length INPUT_MAX_LENGTH
  --example-limit EXAMPLE_LIMIT
